entry.content:
taifoon_buy: description, inputSchema  +mcp.digest, sold per call by Taifoon at 0.0012 USDC (x402); risk.address, sold per call by Taifoon at 0.0012 USDC (x402);  parameters: -["agent.directory", +["mcp.digest", "risk.address", "agent.directory", -["agent.directory"] +["mcp.digest"]
taifoon_grid: description  -inference through the metered GPU gate, +chat completion -key; +key, paid from its balance, on any model of GET /v1/models (endpoint route) or a GPU lane;
introduced -- taifoon_buy: price
